      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:05.80",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5800,
      "text": "Wide shot framed through heavy bed curtains in a dark, candlelit bedchamber. Juliana in her maid's apron sits vigilantly beside the canopied bed where the frail Dowager Duchess lies.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 5800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:05.50",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5500,
      "text": "Juliana glances nervously back toward the door, ensuring no guards are near, before turning her full attention back to the ailing Duchess.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 5500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.80",
      "end_raw": "00:10.50",
      "start_ms": 5800,
      "end_ms": 10500,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana's hands unscrewing the glass dropper from a small amber medicine bottle filled with dark medicinal liquid.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 4700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:06.50",
      "end_raw": "00:09.00",
      "start_ms": 6500,
      "end_ms": 9000,
      "text": "Tense, atmospheric orchestral score builds softly in the background.",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:10.50",
      "end_raw": "00:14.20",
      "start_ms": 10500,
      "end_ms": 14200,
      "text": "Close-up of the Dowager Duchess resting against pale pillows as her heavy eyelids slowly open, her gaze weak and disoriented.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 3700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.00",
      "end_raw": "00:14.00",
      "start_ms": 11000,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "The Dowager Duchess blinks against the dim lamplight, turning her head toward Juliana.",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.20",
      "end_raw": "00:20.50",
      "start_ms": 14200,
      "end_ms": 20500,
      "text": "Low-angle medium two-shot looking past Juliana's silhouette down to the Duchess in bed.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 6300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "DOWAGER DUCHESS (Weak, Raspy)",
      "speaker": "DOWAGER DUCHESS",
      "delivery": [
        "Weak",
        "Raspy"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.20",
      "end_raw": "00:20.20",
      "start_ms": 14200,
      "end_ms": 20200,
      "text": "\"Who are you? Speak to me. I have not seen your face before.\"",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:20.50",
      "end_raw": "00:25.80",
      "start_ms": 20500,
      "end_ms": 25800,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana leaning over the bed, holding the dropper bottle carefully toward the Duchess's mouth, her expression urgent yet tender.",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 5300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Urgent, Reassuring)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Urgent",
        "Reassuring"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:20.60",
      "end_raw": "00:25.40",
      "start_ms": 20600,
      "end_ms": 25400,
      "text": "\"Please, Your Grace. Drink the last of this antidote. Drink it slowly.\"",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:25.80",
      "end_raw": "00:28.50",
      "start_ms": 25800,
      "end_ms": 28500,
      "text": "Extreme close-up of the Duchess taking drops of the dark liquid from the glass bottle onto her lips.",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 2700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:25.80",
      "end_raw": "00:28.40",
      "start_ms": 25800,
      "end_ms": 28400,
      "text": "The Duchess swallows the remedy with difficulty as Juliana carefully tilts the amber bottle.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.50",
      "end_raw": "00:30.80",
      "start_ms": 28500,
      "end_ms": 30800,
      "text": "Medium two-shot as Juliana withdraws the medicine bottle, standing beside the bedside lamp.",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 2300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.80",
      "end_raw": "00:35.80",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "Close-up of the Dowager Duchess observing Juliana with faint recognition through her exhaustion.",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "DOWAGER DUCHESS (Faint, Discerning)",
      "speaker": "DOWAGER DUCHESS",
      "delivery": [
        "Faint",
        "Discerning"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.80",
      "end_raw": "00:35.50",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 35500,
      "text": "\"You... you are no common servant. You took Catherine's whip for me the other day.\"",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 4700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:35.80",
      "end_raw": "00:40.20",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 40200,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana, her eyes reflecting quiet resolve and pain.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 4400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Humble, Sincere)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Humble",
        "Sincere"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.00",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 36000,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "\"I did what I had to. It does not change my duty.\"",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 3800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:40.20",
      "end_raw": "00:43.20",
      "start_ms": 40200,
      "end_ms": 43200,
      "text": "Medium two-shot as Juliana leans closer to tuck the blankets securely over the Duchess.",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Gentle, Calming)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Gentle",
        "Calming"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:40.30",
      "end_raw": "00:43.00",
      "start_ms": 40300,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "text": "\"Rest now, Your Grace. You are safe tonight.\"",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 2700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.20",
      "end_raw": "00:47.50",
      "start_ms": 43200,
      "end_ms": 47500,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana looking around the shadowy room, her voice dropping to a tense whisper.",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 4300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Hushed, Tense Whisper)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Hushed",
        "Tense Whisper"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.50",
      "end_raw": "00:47.00",
      "start_ms": 43500,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "text": "\"If the guards hear us, we are both dead.\"",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.50",
      "end_raw": "00:50.80",
      "start_ms": 47500,
      "end_ms": 50800,
      "text": "Static shot of the heavy carved double doors to the bedchamber, left slightly ajar with a sliver of hallway candlelight gleaming through the gap.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 3300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:50.80",
      "end_raw": "00:55.80",
      "start_ms": 50800,
      "end_ms": 55800,
      "text": "Close-up of the Dowager Duchess lying back, processing Juliana's warning as dark realization settles into her face.",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:52.50",
      "end_raw": "00:55.50",
      "start_ms": 52500,
      "end_ms": 55500,
      "text": "The Duchess clutches the blanket against her chest, her breathing quickening with dismay.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:55.80",
      "end_raw": "01:02.50",
      "start_ms": 55800,
      "end_ms": 62500,
      "text": "Medium close-up of the Duchess looking upward toward Juliana, her voice trembling with tragic certainty.",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 6700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "DOWAGER DUCHESS (Trembling, Heartbroken)",
      "speaker": "DOWAGER DUCHESS",
      "delivery": [
        "Trembling",
        "Heartbroken"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:56.00",
      "end_raw": "01:02.00",
      "start_ms": 56000,
      "end_ms": 62000,
      "text": "\"Rupert and Catherine want me dead. They are poisoning me in my own bed, aren't they?\"",
      "line_number": 114,
      "duration_ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:02.50",
      "end_raw": "01:07.00",
      "start_ms": 62500,
      "end_ms": 67000,
      "text": "Medium shot of Juliana leaning over the edge of the mattress, nodding earnestly to soothe her fears.",
      "line_number": 118,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Reassuring, Steadfast)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Reassuring",
        "Steadfast"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:02.60",
      "end_raw": "01:06.70",
      "start_ms": 62600,
      "end_ms": 66700,
      "text": "\"Yes. But the charcoal is fighting the poison. You are safe now.\"",
      "line_number": 122,
      "duration_ms": 4100
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:07.00",
      "end_raw": "01:11.80",
      "start_ms": 67000,
      "end_ms": 71800,
      "text": "Close-up of the small amber dropper bottle sitting atop the polished wooden bedside table in the dim glow of the lamp.",
      "line_number": 126,
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:11.80",
      "end_raw": "01:19.60",
      "start_ms": 71800,
      "end_ms": 79600,
      "text": "Medium shot of the Dowager Duchess looking intently at Juliana from her pillows, studying her bearing.",
      "line_number": 130,
      "duration_ms": 7800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "DOWAGER DUCHESS (Curious, Searching)",
      "speaker": "DOWAGER DUCHESS",
      "delivery": [
        "Curious",
        "Searching"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:13.80",
      "end_raw": "01:19.40",
      "start_ms": 73800,
      "end_ms": 79400,
      "text": "\"Then tell me... why is a girl of such noble spirit working as a common maid?\"",
      "line_number": 134,
      "duration_ms": 5600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:19.60",
      "end_raw": "01:26.50",
      "start_ms": 79600,
      "end_ms": 86500,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana, her chin lifting with dignified sorrow and quiet defiance.",
      "line_number": 138,
      "duration_ms": 6900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP026_B033",
      "episode_id": "EP026",
      "file_index": 32,
      "scene_id": "EP026_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Painful, Proud)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Painful",
        "Proud"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:20.00",
      "end_raw": "01:25.80",
      "start_ms": 80000,
      "end_ms": 85800,
      "text": "\"Because my family cast me out to rot. I have nothing left in this world but my honor.\"",
      "line_number": 142,
      "duration_ms": 5800
